+ ValueRead is Struct

` A property of the receiver that the value a class writes for another property reads, by a
` name the binder resolved to a member or after the receiver: the instance that types the
` value, the property's name, where it is read, and whether the value evaluates the read
` whenever it is evaluated. With these emission orders the first values of an object's
` properties, and knows which an initializer evaluates again. The instance's row says the
` rest: `reads-self` that the value names the receiver, so it may read any property, and
` `branches` that it may evaluate a part of itself and not another.

+ instance InstanceId
+ name Atom
+ syntax SyntaxId
+ surely Bool

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
