if slot
    replacing[slot] = true

────────────────────
+ is-replacing Bool
    - instance InstanceId
    - syntax SyntaxId

` Whether a node stores an array over an array.
slot != null && replacing[slot] != null

.. slot = node-slot(instance, syntax)

