+ do set-bullet-site
    - instance InstanceId
    - bullet SyntaxId
    - site SyntaxId
    - below Bool

` Keeps where the facts of a bullet are recorded: what converts what it yields, and for one
` that gives every item of a container the calls of the container's protocol. The reference
` keeps those of the first bullet of a list apart from it, beside others. `below` says the
` reference locates the loop of a bullet that gives every item on the line under it.
. slot = node-slot(instance, bullet)
if slot
    bullet-sites[slot] = (site as U64) + (if below then 4294967296u64 else 0u64)

────────────────────
+ do set-protocol-start
    - instance InstanceId
    - bullet SyntaxId
    - site SyntaxId
    - mark Size

` Keeps the first call of a container's protocol for a bullet that gives every item of the
` container: the first recorded at `site` for the function since `mark`, where the calls of
` the protocol follow it beside others.
. slot = node-slot(instance, bullet)
if !slot
    =
for position in mark .. < calls.length
    . call = calls[position]
    if call.instance == instance && call.syntax == site
        protocol-starts[slot] = position as U32
        =

────────────────────
+ protocol-start FactId
    - instance InstanceId
    - bullet SyntaxId

` The first call of the protocol of the container a bullet gives every item of, or none.
if !slot then no-fact else protocol-starts[slot] ?? no-fact

.. slot = node-slot(instance, bullet)

