fills.append(fact)
chain-fact(fill-lasts, fill-priors, fact.instance, id)

────────────────────
+ latest-fill-of FactId
    - instance InstanceId

` The last value an instance gave a property, or no fact. Instances keep their own fills until
` typing ends and those of initializers are folded.
latest-of(fill-lasts, instance)

────────────────────
+ prior-fill FactId
    - id FactId

` The value the instance of one gave a property before it, or no fact.
prior-of(fill-priors, id)

────────────────────
+ latest-conversion-of FactId
    - instance InstanceId

` The last conversion an instance recorded, or no fact.
