+ do absorb-diagnostics
    - peer Facts
    - ids PeerIds
    - taken [Bool]

` Takes in what the peer reported of each of its instances `taken` flags, which no pass typed:
` what typing a default of a parameter of such a function where a call first took it reported.
for row in peer.diagnostics
    if taken[row.instance]
        absorb-diagnostic(peer, ids, row)

────────────────────
_ do absorb-diagnostic
    - peer Facts
    - ids PeerIds
    - row TypeDiagnostic

. fact = row
fact.instance = ids.instance(row.instance)
fact.from = ids.type(row.from)
fact.to = ids.type(row.to)
fact.mentions = RowRange'TypeId(diagnostic-mentions.length as U32, row.mentions.count)
for offset in 0 .. < row.mentions.count
    diagnostic-mentions += ids.type(peer.diagnostic-mentions[row.mentions.start + offset])
fact.members = RowRange'DeclRef(diagnostic-members.length as U32, row.members.count)
diagnostic-members ++= peer.diagnostic-members[row.members.start .. < row.members.end]
diagnostics.append(fact)

